Let me explain how to use uni-data-picker with cloud database data:
```html
<uni-data-picker
  v-model="value"
  :collection="collectionName"
  field="text"
  orderby="value asc"
  @change="onChange"
></uni-data-picker>
```
```javascript
export default {
  data() {
    return {
      value: '',
      collectionName: 'your-collection-name' // Your cloud database collection name
    }
  },
  methods: {
    onChange(e) {
      console.log('Selected value:', e)
    }
  }
}
```
Key points:
- Set the `collection` prop to your cloud database collection name
- Use `field` prop to specify which field to display as text
- `orderby` lets you sort the data
- The component will automatically fetch data from the cloud database
